Third-party content
-------------------

The drone model in Content/Models (SM_UBotDrone_*, M_UBotDrone, T_UBotDrone_*) is
based on "Animated Drone" by HARTWEL JUNIOR KISAKA, from Fab:
https://www.fab.com/listings/c1f5f392-330a-418c-b0b0-e3c89639347f
It is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
The Apache License does not apply to it.

Changes made: converted from a skinned glTF model to static meshes (one body mesh
and clockwise and counter-clockwise propeller meshes centered on their hubs),
scaled by 2, re-oriented so the nose faces +X, all materials merged into one,
textures resized to 1024x1024 and converted from specular-glossiness to
metallic-roughness, normal map green channel flipped. The animations are not
included.
